          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Your manual decides.</strong> Some manufacturers recommend a
            surge protector and some say to plug straight into a grounded wall outlet — but almost
